OL,3,ADolly Parton's manager accuses her
OL,4,Anephew of 'threats and intimidation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's management company has
OL,7,Faccused her nephew of "threats,
OL,8,Fintimidation, and coercion", revealing
OL,9,Fa bitter battle over the late star's
OL,10,Flegacy and business interests.
OL,12,FThe accusations against Bryan Seaver,
OL,13,Fwho was Parton's head of security and
OL,14,Fwas handpicked to announce her death
OL,15,Flast month, have been made public in US
OL,16,Flegal documents filed this week.
OL,18,FThe company that manages Parton's
OL,19,Fbusinesses and properties, She's Alive,
OL,20,Fis seeking a temporary civil
OL,21,Frestraining order against him.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
